# Production Management UI (v1)

## Philosophy
Information first. Status readable in ~3s. Low noise. 8+ hour daily use. No heavy gradients, shadows, glass, or decorative animation.

## Reconcile with `typography_font_stack_v1`
| Role | Size | Weight | Case | Color |
|------|------|--------|------|-------|
| **Block title** (SCHEDULE, DEPARTMENTS) | 10–11px | 800 | UPPERCASE optional | Zinc-500 (`text_meta`) |
| **In-card field label** (Delivery, Assignee, Modelling group) | **12px** | 500–600 | Title case | `#a1a1aa` (`text_label`) |
| **Body / values** | 13–14px | 500 | — | Zinc-200/300 |
| **Metadata** (dates, version, hints) | 12px mono or sans | 500 | — | `#71717a` (`text_meta`) |

Use **max 3 visual sizes** per card: block title · body · metadata.

## Containers (Rules 02–04)
- **Page BG**: `#121214` (`content_bg`)
- **Panel BG**: `#18181b` (`panel`)
- **Card BG**: **brighter than panel** — e.g. `#1e2124` (+4–8% brightness). Never same as panel.
- **Nested sub-card** (inside card): brighter again — e.g. `#25282c`, padding **12px**, radius **6px**, same border token.
- **Card border**: `1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)` — not heavy shadow.
- **Card padding**: **16px**
- **Sub-card content indent**: **8px**; card content indent: **12px**
- **Spacing**: 8pt grid only — `4, 8, 16, 24, 32` (no 6, 10, 13, 19…)

## Status (Rules 07–08)
One color = one meaning. **Status visible before** task name / dept chip in compact rows.

| Meaning | Color |
|---------|-------|
| Approved / Done | Green `#10b981` |
| Published | Cyan (pipeline token) |
| Working / In progress | Orange / Blue (pipeline token — pick one per surface) |
| Waiting | Gray `#71717a` |
| Review | Blue |
| Blocked / Overdue | Red `#ef4444` |

## Cards & actions (Rules 09–10, 15–16)
- One card = one purpose (Status · Schedule · Files · Notes — separate).
- Card header weight > content weight.
- **Most-used action first** in header (e.g. Open before Edit).
- **One primary button** per context; rest secondary (`DialogSecondaryButton`).

## Progress (Rule 18)
Prefer bar + percentage over number alone (`_ScheduleTimelineBar` pattern).

## Thumbnail (Rule 17)
Inspector identity: target **25–30%** height for preview, **70–75%** data (future pass on `_IdentityBlock`).

## Enforcement
- Global QSS in `monostudio/ui_qt/style.py` — object names e.g. `InspectorScheduleCard`, `InspectorFieldLabel`.
- Layout constants in widget modules (`_CARD_PAD = 16`, `_CONTENT_INDENT = 12`).
